# Demo Video — Online Shopping System

 ## 1\. Introduction

 Hello everyone. In this demo, I will demonstrate our Online Shopping System.

 The system allows users to register, log in, browse products, add products to the cart, complete payment, and track their orders.

 ## 2\. User Registration

 First, the user opens the application and selects the Register option.

 The user enters their name, email address, phone number, and password. After submitting the registration form, the account is created successfully.

 ## 3\. User Login

 Next, the user enters their registered email and password.

 After successful authentication, the user is redirected to the home page.

 ## 4\. Browse Products

 The home page displays the available products.

 The user can search for a product, view product details, check the price and availability, and select the required quantity.

 ## 5\. Add to Cart

 The user selects a product and clicks the Add to Cart button.

 The selected product is added to the shopping cart. The user can change the quantity or remove an item.

 ## 6\. Checkout

 After reviewing the cart, the user clicks Checkout.

 The user enters the delivery address and selects a payment method.

 ## 7\. Order Confirmation

 After successful payment, the system creates the order and displays an order confirmation message.

 The user can view the order number, products, total amount, and order status.

 ## 8\. Order Tracking

 Finally, the user can open the Orders page to track the order.

 The order status can be displayed as Confirmed, Packed, Shipped, or Delivered.

 ## 9\. Conclusion

 This completes the demonstration of our Online Shopping System.

 Thank you.

